Z||000029||JBGehling||11-22-2000||05:43 PM||||Hey FNXRising, <BR>     Thanks for all the info on the delorean, your a lucky guy :)! Also, could you give me a little info on the Bricklin (because I think those are even cooler than deloreans)!<BR>Josh<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000030||JohnnyK||11-22-2000||06:24 PM||||Ugh.. Bricklins are NOT cooler than DeLoreans... "Sort Of" a Ford product (can I go on instead of him? He can correct me).. They are powered by 350's and only came in automatic, and I believe that there is an air compressor for the doors.||||reg||1
